type: software
title: "OpenBNCT: a transport-neutral BNCT dosimetry and verification research workbench"
authors:
  - name: "Avila Labs"
url: "https://github.com/AvilaLabs/OpenBNCT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/AvilaLabs/OpenBNCT"
license: MIT
version: "0.2.2"
date-released: "2026-09-22"
keywords:
  - boron neutron capture therapy
  - BNCT
  - dosimetry
  - Monte Carlo
  - radiation transport
  - verification
abstract: >-
  OpenBNCT is an open research workbench for transport-neutral boron
  neutron capture therapy (BNCT) dosimetry and independent verification.
  It provides frozen input contracts, component-wise physical dose
  bundles (boron, nitrogen, hydrogen, photon), biological effectiveness
  application, measurement-record comparison against published beam
  characterizations, and content-bound provenance throughout. Research
  software — not for clinical use.
